/* 调整今天：骨架、卡片与底部操作坞来自 s9；保留时间步进器、
 * 精力选项、岸岸建议卡与变动标签等页面特有控件。 */

.current-card {
  position: relative;
  overflow: hidden;
}

.current-card__label {
  color: var(--ink-3);
  font-size: var(--text-body);
  font-weight: 700;
}

.current-card__chips {
  display: flex;
  flex-wrap: wrap;
  gap: 16rpx;
  margin-top: 16rpx;
}

.current-chip {
  padding: 8rpx 16rpx;
  border-radius: var(--figma-radius-pill);
  background: var(--line);
  color: var(--color-ink-secondary);
  font-size: var(--text-body);
  font-weight: 700;
}

.current-chip--blue {
  background: var(--figma-color-info-soft);
  color: var(--figma-color-info);
}

.current-card__focus {
  margin-top: 16rpx;
  color: var(--color-ink-secondary);
  font-size: var(--text-body-lg);
  font-weight: 500;
  line-height: 1.55;
}

.current-card__focus-value {
  color: var(--ink);
  font-weight: 700;
}

.time-stepper {
  display: flex;
  box-sizing: border-box;
  min-height: 112rpx;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: space-between;
  padding: 16rpx 24rpx;
  border: 1rpx solid var(--line);
  border-radius: var(--radius-32);
  background: var(--bg);
}

button.stepper-button {
  position: relative;
  width: 72rpx;
  height: 72rpx;
  flex: none;
  margin: 0;
  border: 1rpx solid var(--line);
  border-radius: 50%;
  background: var(--color-surface);
  box-shadow: var(--shadow-crisp);
}

.control-disabled {
  opacity: 0.35;
}

.minus-icon,
.plus-icon {
  position: absolute;
  top: 34rpx;
  left: 23rpx;
  width: 26rpx;
  height: 4rpx;
  border-radius: var(--radius-capsule);
  background: var(--color-ink-secondary);
}

.plus-icon::after {
  position: absolute;
  top: -11rpx;
  left: 11rpx;
  width: 4rpx;
  height: 26rpx;
  border-radius: var(--radius-capsule);
  background: var(--ink);
  content: "";
}

.time-value {
  display: flex;
  min-width: 220rpx;
  align-items: baseline;
  justify-content: center;
}

.time-value__number {
  font-size: var(--text-title-lg);
  font-weight: 700;
  letter-spacing: -1rpx;
  line-height: 1;
}

.time-presets {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: repeat(4, minmax(0, 1fr));
  gap: 16rpx;
  margin-top: 24rpx;
}

.time-preset {
  min-width: 0;
  min-height: 68rpx;
  margin: 0;
  padding: 0 8rpx;
  border-radius: var(--radius-24);
  background: var(--bg);
  color: var(--color-ink-secondary);
  font-size: var(--text-caption);
  font-weight: 700;
  line-height: 1.2;
}

.time-preset--active {
  background: var(--color-primary);
  color: var(--color-surface);
}

.energy-options {
  display: flex;
  gap: 24rpx;
}

.energy-option {
  min-width: 0;
  min-height: 84rpx;
  flex: 1;
  margin: 0;
  padding: 0 8rpx;
  border: 1rpx solid var(--line);
  border-radius: var(--radius-32);
  background: var(--color-surface);
  color: var(--color-ink-secondary);
  font-size: var(--text-body-lg);
  font-weight: 700;
  box-shadow: var(--shadow-soft);
}

.energy-option--active {
  border-color: var(--color-primary);
  background: var(--color-primary);
  color: var(--color-surface);
  box-shadow: var(--shadow-elevated);
}

button.time-preset {
  width: 100%;
}

button.energy-option {
  width: auto;
}

.suggestion-card {
  position: relative;
  box-sizing: border-box;
  overflow: hidden;
  padding: 32rpx;
  border: 1rpx solid rgba(165, 243, 252, 0.55);
  border-radius: var(--radius-48);
  background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(239, 246, 255, 0.85), rgba(236, 254, 255, 0.85));
}

.suggestion-card__aurora {
  position: absolute;
  top: -80rpx;
  right: -80rpx;
  width: 240rpx;
  height: 240rpx;
  border-radius: 50%;
  background: rgba(103, 232, 249, 0.2);
  filter: blur(44rpx);
}

.suggestion-card__content {
  position: relative;
  z-index: 1;
}

.suggestion-card__heading {
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 16rpx;
  color: var(--figma-color-cyan-deep);
  font-size: var(--text-section);
  font-weight: 700;
}

.suggestion-card__spark {
  color: var(--figma-color-cyan-deep);
  font-size: var(--text-title-sm);
}

.suggestion-card__headline {
  margin-top: 24rpx;
  color: var(--figma-color-cyan-deep);
  font-size: var(--text-body-lg);
  font-weight: 700;
  line-height: 1.55;
}

.suggestion-card__copy {
  margin-top: 12rpx;
  color: rgba(22, 78, 99, 0.88);
  font-size: var(--text-body-lg);
  font-weight: 500;
  line-height: 1.65;
}

.change-list {
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  gap: 24rpx;
}

.change-card--orange {
  background: var(--bg);
}

.change-card__top {
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: space-between;
  gap: 20rpx;
}

.change-tag {
  padding: 4rpx 16rpx;
  border-radius: var(--figma-radius-pill);
  font-size: var(--text-micro);
  font-weight: 700;
}

.change-tag--blue {
  background: var(--figma-color-info-soft);
  color: var(--figma-color-info);
}

.change-tag--cyan {
  background: var(--figma-color-cyan-soft);
  color: var(--figma-color-cyan-deep);
}

.change-tag--indigo {
  background: var(--color-surface-soft);
  color: var(--color-ink-secondary);
}

.change-tag--green {
  background: var(--good-soft);
  color: var(--good);
}

.change-tag--orange {
  background: var(--figma-color-warning-soft);
  color: var(--figma-color-warning-deep);
}

.change-duration {
  color: var(--ink);
  font-size: var(--text-body);
  font-weight: 700;
}

.change-title {
  margin-top: 24rpx;
  font-size: var(--text-section);
  font-weight: 700;
}

.change-copy {
  margin-top: 8rpx;
  color: var(--ink-2);
  font-size: var(--text-body);
  font-weight: 500;
  line-height: 1.55;
}

.change-empty {
  color: var(--ink-2);
  font-size: var(--text-body-lg);
  font-weight: 500;
  line-height: 1.6;
}

.impact-card {
  display: flex;
  align-items: flex-start;
  gap: 24rpx;
}

.impact-card__icon {
  width: 40rpx;
  height: 40rpx;
  flex: none;
  margin-top: 4rpx;
}

.impact-card__title {
  font-size: var(--text-section);
  font-weight: 700;
}

.impact-card__copy {
  margin-top: 8rpx;
  color: var(--ink-2);
  font-size: var(--text-body);
  font-weight: 500;
  line-height: 1.6;
}

.adjustment-note {
  display: flex;
  align-items: flex-start;
  gap: 20rpx;
  padding: 32rpx;
  border-radius: var(--radius-40);
  background: var(--bg);
  color: var(--ink-2);
  font-size: var(--text-body);
  font-weight: 500;
  line-height: 1.6;
}

.adjustment-note__icon {
  display: flex;
  width: 32rpx;
  height: 32rpx;
  flex: none;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: center;
  margin-top: 3rpx;
  border: 3rpx solid var(--ink-3);
  border-radius: 50%;
  color: var(--ink-3);
  font-size: var(--text-micro);
  font-weight: 800;
  line-height: 1;
}
